WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:18.860 --> 00:01:20.650
You've arrived, Yugi.

00:01:20.650 --> 00:01:25.450
I was worried the shock of Jonouchi's defeat would break your spirit.

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:27.510
But I didn't need to.

00:01:27.510 --> 00:01:29.800
This is our duel of destiny.

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:32.440
My Obelisk or your Slifer!

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:34.650
We'll learn which is stronger!

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:43.010
Yugi, I will defeat you and collect the three God Cards to obtain the title of Duel King!

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:49.020
Three Knights Who Summon God

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:05.600
Due to Exchange's effect, Slifer is now in my hand!

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:09.710
I'll let you have it for now.

00:02:09.710 --> 00:02:13.710
But I'll be the one who has all the God Cards in the end.

00:02:13.710 --> 00:02:18.780
Besides, simply having a God in your hand is worthless.

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:25.220
Lightforce Sword has sealed away my Obelisk for two more turns.

00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:26.490
However...

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:32.400
By combining two monsters, my XY-Dragon Cannon will destroy all your monsters.

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:38.040
You'll never get the three tributes necessary to summon your God.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:43.770
But for me, two turns is plenty of time to gather three tributes on my field.

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:48.920
When Lightforce Sword's effect ends, God will arrive.

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:53.650
I was able to get Slifer into my hand.

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:56.590
But Exchange was a dangerous gamble.

00:02:57.100 --> 00:03:01.030
Exchange forced us to swap a card in our hands.

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:03.960
Now you pick.

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:13.040
Life Shaver.

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:20.610
After setting this, he has to discard a card for every turn that passes until its activation.

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:26.050
The number of cards in his hand determines Slifer's attack points.

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:32.100
If Life Shaver eliminates his entire hand, even a God will be powerless.

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:39.100
Kaiba will definitely set Life Shaver next turn.

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:42.030
Yugi, it's your turn.

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:44.660
My turn!  I draw!

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:51.910
I summon Big Shield Gardna in defense position!

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:54.240
I also set a card.

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:56.910
I end my turn.

00:03:57.370 --> 00:04:02.850
Nothing I have can fight back against XY-Dragon Cannon's attack.

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:06.600
You can only defend.

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:09.730
You sealed away my God for nothing.

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:17.170
When Lightforce Sword's effect ends in two turns, Kaiba will summon Obelisk.

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:24.540
Yugi won't be able to summon Slifer, and he'll lose any chance of winning.

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:28.050
Yugi, don't disappoint me.

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:32.980
Be more worthy of being sacrificed to the darkness.

00:04:33.340 --> 00:04:37.160
Crushing a weakling is boring.

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:40.420
So keep fighting as hard as you can.

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:45.790
I want you to feel ultimate pain, Yugi.

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:53.870
I have a bad feeling...

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:54.740
Anzu?

00:04:55.130 --> 00:04:57.390
It's nothing.

00:04:57.390 --> 00:05:00.480
Anyway, what's taking Honda so long?

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:04.010
The impact was strong enough to disable the Battle Ship's engines.

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:06.090
It could've also damaged the radio.

00:05:06.090 --> 00:05:10.060
So the rescue helicopter isn't coming?

00:05:10.060 --> 00:05:12.360
Oh no...  Brother...

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:17.880
It'll be fine, Shizuka.

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:20.220
Mokuba will work something out.

00:05:20.220 --> 00:05:21.310
But...

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:22.460
He's right.

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:25.070
Let's trust him and wait for now.

00:05:25.070 --> 00:05:25.930
Okay.

00:05:30.170 --> 00:05:31.470
Yugi...

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:44.350
Okay!  It's my turn!  I draw!

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:48.180
Oh yeah!  I always draw the right card!

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:51.520
I summon Axe Raider in attack position!

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:53.480
Attack Petit Dragon!

00:05:53.480 --> 00:05:54.340
What?

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:05.440
Yeah!  You have 0 life points!

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:06.770
I win!

00:06:06.770 --> 00:06:08.380
Damn!

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:11.800
All right!  I passed the 2nd round, Yugi!

00:06:12.900 --> 00:06:15.350
Honda?  Anzu?

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:16.880
Where's Grandpa?

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:21.360
What?  No one saw my moment of triumph?

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:24.970
They're so mean.  Sheesh.

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:29.770
Everyone!

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:34.710
Where did you go?

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.540
This is the Battle Ship!

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.880
Someone answer!

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:42.980
It's no good.

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:47.050
Won't it be faster to fix the Battle Ship's engines?

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:48.990
We're doing that too.

00:06:48.990 --> 00:06:51.260
But they say it'll take time.

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:54.400
Can't anything be done?

00:07:03.240 --> 00:07:07.600
Rishido, the Gods will soon come here.

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:13.940
Destiny that has lasted for 3,000 years have drawn them together to fight.

00:07:13.940 --> 00:07:16.060
This fate is unavoidable.

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:17.110
Yes...

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:21.220
Since that time, their destiny was underway.

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:26.700
That's...

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:28.270
Yugi!

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:32.700
And above him is Dark Magician!

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:37.160
There's a young priest fighting the Pharaoh.

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:43.560
Above him is clearly Blue-Eyes White Dragon.

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:52.280
The young Pharaoh controls a dark spellcaster, and a priest with a white beast confronts him.

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:58.090
This mural depicts an ancient battle between duelists.

00:07:58.090 --> 00:08:06.530
I believe that the souls of the Pharaoh and the priest in this mural are destined to meet again.

00:08:07.140 --> 00:08:09.970
Even after 3,000 years.

00:08:09.970 --> 00:08:11.520
Nonsense!

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:13.640
This is a fake!

00:08:13.640 --> 00:08:15.520
I've wasted my time.

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:23.410
Look at the three cards drawn at the top of the mural.

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:25.850
Obelisk the Tormentor.

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:28.280
Slifer the Sky Dragon.

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:30.180
The Winged Dragon of Ra.

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:32.560
Three God Monsters.

00:08:32.560 --> 00:08:37.020
Archaeologists call them God Cards.

00:08:37.020 --> 00:08:38.320
God Cards?

00:08:38.320 --> 00:08:43.660
Pegasus created three rare cards based on these carvings.

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:47.040
You must have heard of them.

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:55.200
Whoever acquires all three rare cards will reign at the top of all duelists with an undefeated legend.

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:58.510
He will be the King of Kings.

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:03.390
And this card.

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:05.440
This is...

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:07.490
Obelisk the Tormentor!

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:11.400
The other two cards were stolen.

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:15.930
In order to get them back, I entrust Obelisk the Tormentor to you.

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:18.930
You want me to use this card to lure them?

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:21.920
Are you sure you want to trust me that much?

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:26.640
What if I get the rare cards back but won't give them to you?

00:09:28.120 --> 00:09:30.210
I trust you.

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:38.590
It was decided 3,000 years ago that the ones chosen by the God Cards would battle.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:42.250
No one knows the outcome of this battle.

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:45.760
Which one will win?

00:09:52.970 --> 00:09:55.970
Who will summon their God?

00:09:57.910 --> 00:10:01.480
And what will happen after that?

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:05.780
We must watch what happens.

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:09.100
No matter the outcome.

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:30.310
Kaiba!  Kaiba!

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:35.620
He must summon Slifer to destroy my monsters.

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:38.770
But I won't let him summon a God so easily.

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:40.980
I'll summon my God first.

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:45.550
My turn!  I draw!

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:52.790
Everything is working in my favor!

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:57.930
I set a card!

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:02.520
His set card is probably Life Shaver.

00:11:02.920 --> 00:11:05.400
You can no longer win.

00:11:05.400 --> 00:11:07.110
Prepare to lose, Yugi.

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:12.240
Next, I summon Z-Metal Tank in attack position!

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:15.650
The third magnet monster!

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:22.320
When the X, Y and Z magnet monsters are summoned, their effects activate!

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:23.620
And...

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:40.370
Combine!  XYZ-Dragon Cannon!

00:11:43.850 --> 00:11:45.970
2800 attack points!

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:50.120
I don't have a monster that can withstand those attack points.

00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:54.060
And when Obelisk's seal vanishes next turn...

00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:58.490
...he'll tribute X, Y, and Z to summon his God.

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:01.500
Well done, Kaiba.

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:04.930
I can see why you were able to defeat my sister.

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:08.370
XYZ-Dragon Cannon attacks!

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:12.420
This attack will destroy Big Shield Gardna!

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:15.040
XYZ Hyper Cannon!

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:29.800
After destroying all your monsters, I'll pulverize your soul into nothing!

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:38.430
Kaiba, I knew you'd destroy Big Shield Gardna first because it has the most defense points.

00:12:38.430 --> 00:12:39.480
What?

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:42.200
Now I have a chance to win!

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:43.970
I flip over my set card!

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:47.170
I activate my trap, Soul Rope!

00:12:47.380 --> 00:12:48.480
What?

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:58.250
When my monster is destroyed, I can pay 1000 life points to summon a Level 4 monster from my deck!

00:12:58.250 --> 00:12:59.940
And the card is...

00:13:00.850 --> 00:13:03.020
I summon King's Knight!

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:09.250
That's not all.  When King's Knight and Queen's Knight are on the field...

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:11.330
King and Queen...  It can't be!

00:13:11.330 --> 00:13:15.920
Yes.  I can Special Summon Jack from my deck!

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:18.020
A three monster combo!

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:21.050
Just like your three magnet monsters...

00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:25.210
...my deck has monsters to summon my God!

00:13:25.210 --> 00:13:27.950
Come out, Jack's Knight!

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:39.330
Now I have three monsters to tribute!

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:46.270
I was in total control of this game, but Yugi is going to summon his God first?

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:48.600
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:51.740
I tribute my three monsters to the heavens!

00:14:01.280 --> 00:14:04.950
I summon Slifer the Sky Dragon!

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:38.590
What's that?

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:41.020
Slifer the Sky Dragon.

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:43.970
A God has finally been summoned.

00:14:43.970 --> 00:14:45.930
How surprising.

00:14:45.930 --> 00:14:50.200
I didn't think Yugi would summon a God first in this situation.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:51.570
Interesting.

00:14:52.710 --> 00:14:57.510
Kaiba!  By summoning Slifer, the shoe is on the other foot!

00:14:58.660 --> 00:14:59.970
Are you sure?

00:14:59.970 --> 00:15:01.940
Look at your hand.

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:09.040
The number of cards in your hand determines Slifer's attack and defense points.

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:13.050
You only have three cards in your hand this turn!

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:17.020
Slifer the Sky Dragon has 3000 attack points.

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:22.730
But your XYZ-Dragon Cannon has 2800 attack points!

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:26.170
I can attack and destroy it this turn.

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:32.530
With no monsters left to tribute, you can't summon Obelisk next turn!

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:36.760
Then go ahead and attack.

00:15:36.760 --> 00:15:38.700
Despite the circumstances...

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:45.890
...Kaiba really believes XYZ-Dragon Cannon will survive God's attack?

00:15:45.890 --> 00:15:51.320
The difference between Slifer and his monster's attack points is only 200.

00:15:51.320 --> 00:15:57.770
I thought his set card was Life Shaver that he took from my hand.

00:15:57.770 --> 00:16:01.450
But not even a turn has passed yet.

00:16:01.450 --> 00:16:06.210
He can't use it to make me discard a card and lower Slifer's attack points.

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:08.000
What's wrong, Yugi?

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:09.480
Attack me!

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:14.510
Is Kaiba bluffing?  Or...

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:21.400
Even though Yugi summoned a God, he's keeping Yugi at bay with a single set card.

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:23.390
Not bad, Kaiba.

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:29.330
Whether you attack or not, I'm still going to win.

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:37.460
If that card raises XYZ-Dragon Cannon's attack points, Slifer will be destroyed.

00:16:37.770 --> 00:16:43.210
But If I don't attack this turn, he'll summon Obelisk next turn.

00:16:44.880 --> 00:16:48.450
What if his dare is a bluff?

00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:54.020
Then his set card could be Life Shaver, as I predicted.

00:16:57.280 --> 00:17:00.190
Now isn't the time to be scared!

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:03.440
Slifer the Sky Dragon attacks!

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:06.430
I knew it!

00:17:06.640 --> 00:17:08.640
Thunder Force!

00:17:12.540 --> 00:17:14.180
I flip over my set card!

00:17:14.180 --> 00:17:16.960
Interdimensional Matter Transporter!

00:17:17.290 --> 00:17:19.880
Not Life Shaver?

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:27.960
XYZ-Dragon Cannon transports!

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:35.000
Due to this spell, Slifer's target is gone, so its attack is negated!

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:40.080
What?

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:41.520
What's going on?

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:44.370
I don't know, but I saw a flash up there.

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:48.210
This is Slifer's power.

00:17:50.360 --> 00:17:52.300
What was that?

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:53.960
I don't know.

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:57.000
Maybe something happened at the Duel Tower.

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:01.030
This is Kaiba Corporation's Head Office.

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:03.060
Battle Ship!  Please respond!

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:05.300
This is Kaiba Corporation's Head Office!

00:18:05.300 --> 00:18:06.600
Please respond!

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:07.600
The signal...

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:08.630
...went through!

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:19.260
The helicopter is coming!

00:18:19.260 --> 00:18:20.500
Everything'll be fine!

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:23.380
Okay!  I'll tell Shizuka!

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:27.030
The radio interference has weakened.

00:18:27.030 --> 00:18:28.860
I can transmit visuals now.

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:32.780
I'm gonna go cheer for my brother!

00:18:40.460 --> 00:18:42.800
What's going on?

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:52.140
XYZ-Dragon Cannon disappeared.

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:57.580
You wasted your turn, Yugi.

00:18:57.580 --> 00:18:59.060
I see.

00:18:59.060 --> 00:19:03.010
You set that card so that you'd have tributes to summon your God.

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:07.120
But my turn isn't over yet!

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:12.220
I'll also set a card!

00:19:12.220 --> 00:19:15.520
What?  You reduced your hand?

00:19:15.740 --> 00:19:17.160
I end my turn.

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:20.780
Unbelievable!  He only has two cards in his hand!

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:26.770
Despite knowing that I'll summon Obelisk with 4000 attack points next turn!

00:19:26.770 --> 00:19:29.330
Kaiba, it's your turn.

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:31.280
Even if you don't summon a God...

00:19:31.280 --> 00:19:36.680
...XYZ-Dragon Cannon has enough attack points to destroy my Slifer.

00:19:38.480 --> 00:19:43.500
Now I'm testing your resolve this turn, Kaiba!

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:50.600
No matter what you say, I know my next move.

00:19:50.820 --> 00:19:51.960
I draw!

00:19:53.400 --> 00:20:00.470
Lightforce Sword's effect ends this turn, so Obelisk returns to my hand.

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:05.080
I'll show you my God.

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:08.510
I tribute XYZ-Dragon Cannon!

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:14.180
Obelisk!  The God of Destruction!

00:20:14.180 --> 00:20:19.080
Arrive on my field as my ultimate god!

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:28.680
The almighty power that shakes heaven and earth will bring me victory!

00:20:29.440 --> 00:20:32.210
I summon Obelisk the Tormentor!

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:39.810
It's coming!

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:45.350
With great power!

00:20:54.560 --> 00:20:57.560
I summon Obelisk the Tormentor!

00:20:59.170 --> 00:21:02.000
Obelisk finally appeared!

00:21:02.960 --> 00:21:06.600
The battle between the Gods begins!

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:08.800
Obelisk the Tormentor...

00:21:08.800 --> 00:21:11.240
It's bursting with incredible power!

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:16.050
I've never felt such fear and awe!

00:21:16.050 --> 00:21:20.600
Yugi, It's finally time for our Gods to clash.

00:21:21.640 --> 00:21:27.290
I will defeat your Slifer and acquire all the Gods!

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:31.520
Along with the Duel King title!

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:44.440
The two Gods have finally been summoned.

00:21:44.440 --> 00:21:47.570
Slifer the Sky Dragon and Obelisk the Tormentor.

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:51.910
Their overwhelming powers split the sky and quake the land.

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:55.140
Yugi and Kaiba use their tactics...

00:21:55.140 --> 00:21:57.970
...in a back-and-forth battle between the Gods.

00:21:57.970 --> 00:22:00.440
Neither side is giving an inch.

00:22:00.440 --> 00:22:05.530
When the two Gods clash again, something will happen!

00:22:05.530 --> 00:22:09.530
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Clash!  Slifer vs Obelisk

00:22:09.530 --> 00:22:11.020
Duel, standby!

00:22:13.550 --> 00:22:21.450
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:21.450 --> 00:22:30.390
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:30.730 --> 00:22:35.370
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:35.370 --> 00:22:39.340
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:39.770 --> 00:22:47.310
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:47.310 --> 00:22:50.880
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:50.880 --> 00:22:55.650
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:55.650 --> 00:23:05.760
And walk it without stopping

00:23:05.760 --> 00:23:13.370
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:13.600 --> 00:23:22.340
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:22.340 --> 00:23:30.320
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:30.320 --> 00:23:40.160
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
